{
  "description": "Test vectors for EncryptedBody and Content-Encryption header (AMP v0.1.9). Covers A256GCM and A128CBC-HS256 algorithms, envelope wrapping, and invalid payloads. When the Content-Encryption header is present the envelope body is an EncryptedBody, not the typed body for body_type. A256GCM cases carry real AES-256-GCM output (key 'a256gcm', 96-bit IV, no AAD, plaintext = canonical JSON of sign.plaintext; ciphertext/iv/tag base64url without padding). ampro only defines the EncryptedBody container; key agreement and AAD are not specified by the protocol.",
